{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"三份報章本月起加價　《明報》即日起加至15元\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/NEWSPAPER-ADD-261101-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】三份報章本月起加價。</p><p>其中《明報》即日起，由每份12元增至15元；《經濟日報》周一起同樣由12元增至15元；《信報》周一開始則由15元加至18元，其他報章包括《東方日報》、《星島日報》、《大公報》及《文匯報》等就維持每份12元。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.168291+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T09:10:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:01.819144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:09.397997+00:00","content_hash":"e8cba5e2559d984ba1b77d3c70af5fe392063f67659795f46ddc1f3b0046b56a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}